        1648
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 2 of the Executive Order provides that, except for contracts exempted in accordance with Section 4 thereof, all City contracting agencies shall include in every City contract the provisions of Section 2 designated (1) through (6), (b) and (c).",
